WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 15=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.060
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:45.239 --> 01:49.639
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

01:49.640 --> 01:54.759
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

01:56.239 --> 01:57.679
I came all this way to get you

01:57.920 --> 01:59.759
and missed the best part.

01:59.760 --> 02:02.800
Qin Qiong and Shan Xiongxin
each served their own cause.

02:02.856 --> 02:04.670
One fought
with all his might to defend Tang,

02:04.680 --> 02:06.904
while the other fought
with all his might against Tang.

02:07.159 --> 02:08.600
Both were heroes.

02:09.319 --> 02:10.559
This is the story of

02:10.560 --> 02:13.079
Qin Qiong building a shrine
in honor of Shan Xiongxin?

02:13.080 --> 02:14.680
Let's give her a little reward.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.799
That maid of yours is quite interesting.

02:16.872 --> 02:18.510
It was her first time
in a military camp,

02:18.520 --> 02:19.840
yet she wasn't frightened at all.

02:20.159 --> 02:22.359
Instead, she chatted away

02:22.360 --> 02:23.679
with the soldiers guarding her

02:23.680 --> 02:25.320
and told them stories.

02:25.479 --> 02:26.918
And of all things, she told stories

02:26.919 --> 02:29.359
about common-born heroes
fighting as soldiers,

02:29.360 --> 02:31.519
which was exactly
what the soldiers loved to hear.

02:31.960 --> 02:34.038
One after another,
they came to plead with me,

02:34.039 --> 02:36.199
insisting on hearing
the story to the end.

02:38.039 --> 02:39.239
It was wonderful.

02:39.439 --> 02:41.000
She is rather interesting.

02:41.240 --> 02:41.878
Everyone,

02:41.879 --> 02:43.158
shall we have another one?

02:43.159 --> 02:45.999
Another one!

02:46.000 --> 02:47.318
Want another one?

02:47.319 --> 02:51.400
- Another one!
- Another one!

02:53.080 --> 02:55.352
I heard the ointment
used in the army for chilblains

02:55.360 --> 02:56.878
works much better

02:56.879 --> 02:58.279
than what they sell at apothecaries.

02:58.280 --> 02:59.680
I'd like some.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.880
My mother has chilblains on her hands.

03:03.144 --> 03:05.230
Young Master
was born to wealth and privilege.

03:05.360 --> 03:07.440
You don't know that
for people at the bottom like us,

03:07.560 --> 03:09.400
sometimes simply staying alive

03:09.520 --> 03:11.320
takes everything we have.

03:11.719 --> 03:13.119
If we want to rise above our origins

03:13.120 --> 03:14.600
and live a better life,

03:14.840 --> 03:16.880
we may have to risk our lives.

03:17.560 --> 03:18.680
Aren't you

03:18.719 --> 03:19.919
afraid?

03:19.928 --> 03:21.310
I'm only going into the residence

03:21.319 --> 03:22.880
to see what's going on.

03:23.039 --> 03:24.519
What's there to be afraid of?

03:33.360 --> 03:34.638
Shall we have another one?

03:34.639 --> 03:38.919
- Another one!
- Another one!

03:42.280 --> 03:43.839
Why don't you give her to me?

03:43.840 --> 03:45.840
I'm willing to pay handsomely for her.

03:53.288 --> 03:55.550
It's a rare honor
to have caught Your Lordship's eye.

03:55.560 --> 03:57.800
I should rightfully offer her
to you without hesitation.

03:57.960 --> 03:59.158
But this maid

03:59.159 --> 04:00.840
was given to me by my mother,

04:01.159 --> 04:02.680
so I really can't part with her.

04:05.360 --> 04:07.359
No wonder she's your maid.

04:08.159 --> 04:11.400
When you want to be clear about things,
you call me Commander Yuan.

04:11.560 --> 04:15.039
When you want to play dumb,
you call me Your Lordship.

04:18.639 --> 04:19.559
Another one!

04:19.560 --> 04:20.800
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

04:22.800 --> 04:25.199
The Marquis is here!

04:26.079 --> 04:28.279
- Commander Yuan!
- Commander Yuan!

04:34.360 --> 04:37.288
- Your Lordship. Young Master.
- Your Lordship. Young Master.

04:39.120 --> 04:39.919
Your Young Master

04:39.920 --> 04:41.800
came especially to take you home.

04:41.839 --> 04:43.440
I won't see you off.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.919
The Wo pirates' confessions

04:45.920 --> 04:47.119
should be ready tomorrow.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.159
Come to the
Rear Military Command as well.

04:49.160 --> 04:51.398
You can see what they've confessed to.

04:51.399 --> 04:52.279
All right.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.680
See you tomorrow.

05:08.879 --> 05:10.199
Look at your eyes.

05:11.040 --> 05:12.880
You cried listening to the story?

05:41.480 --> 05:42.519
Young Master,

05:42.680 --> 05:44.480
did I do something wrong?

05:49.079 --> 05:49.920
No.

05:51.360 --> 05:52.359
I told you before,

05:52.360 --> 05:54.279
once it was done,
you'd be well rewarded.

05:54.519 --> 05:55.839
What do you want?

05:58.160 --> 06:00.438
I can't think of anything right now.

06:00.439 --> 06:02.359
Can I save up all my rewards

06:02.360 --> 06:04.120
and ask for them together
once I've decided?

06:07.160 --> 06:08.599
If you keep saving them up,

06:08.712 --> 06:10.648
what if I can't afford them
when the time comes?

06:11.160 --> 06:12.119
No.

06:12.120 --> 06:12.984
Whatever I want,

06:13.000 --> 06:15.120
you'll definitely be able
to give me, Young Master.

06:17.700 --> 06:23.540
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

06:28.399 --> 06:30.199
Don't keep tugging at me.

06:30.759 --> 06:32.079
Why not?

06:32.160 --> 06:33.518
You used to hold my hand,

06:33.519 --> 06:34.800
and even hugged me.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.479
You were little then.

06:36.480 --> 06:38.000
How old are you now?

06:39.464 --> 06:41.176
I was only away at war for a few years,

06:41.224 --> 06:42.990
and now you're treating me
like a stranger.

06:43.000 --> 06:47.700
♪Love and guilt intertwine.
What if the image isn't real?♪

06:47.820 --> 06:53.140
♪I still remember your name♪

06:55.060 --> 07:02.460
♪I no longer blame the moon
for withholding its light♪

07:02.820 --> 07:10.460
♪I only pray that those
I've known still live and thrive♪

07:10.500 --> 07:14.899
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

07:14.900 --> 07:17.900
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

07:17.940 --> 07:21.979
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

07:21.980 --> 07:28.380
♪You and I will walk there together♪

07:47.920 --> 07:49.040
Cuique.

07:57.720 --> 07:58.758
Jinqi.

07:58.759 --> 08:00.560
You're finally back.

08:01.160 --> 08:03.278
Congratulations, Jinqi,
on clearing your name

08:03.279 --> 08:04.680
and being reinstated.

08:05.959 --> 08:07.320
Please sit, both of you.

08:08.160 --> 08:09.279
Cuique,

08:10.720 --> 08:11.759
have a seat.

08:19.759 --> 08:21.359
After what happened to Jinqi,

08:21.360 --> 08:23.880
Zheng and Cuique were both very worried.

08:23.940 --> 08:25.912
They went to the temple
together to offer incense

08:25.944 --> 08:27.190
and pray for Jinqi's safety.

08:27.960 --> 08:29.896
Thank you for going
to all that trouble, Cuique.

08:31.279 --> 08:33.158
You have always
treated my brother and me

08:33.159 --> 08:34.359
like family.

08:34.632 --> 08:36.070
Unfortunately, we're of humble status

08:36.080 --> 08:37.400
and can do little to help.

08:37.480 --> 08:38.920
All I could do was go to the temple

08:38.980 --> 08:41.864
and kowtow a few more times to pray for
the Bodhisattva's protection.

08:42.639 --> 08:44.719
Now that Jinqi has returned safely,

08:44.720 --> 08:46.472
Cuique is going to the temple tomorrow

08:46.488 --> 08:48.070
to offer incense and fulfill her vow.

08:49.320 --> 08:51.079
I want to go, too.

08:53.879 --> 08:55.119
What did Aunt Lingxiao say?

08:56.120 --> 08:58.079
I pestered her
until she got tired of me.

08:58.080 --> 09:00.839
She said if you agree,

09:00.840 --> 09:02.079
then I can go.

09:03.679 --> 09:04.800
Jinqi,

09:04.960 --> 09:07.656
that temple is also known for
granting prayers for a good marriage.

09:08.120 --> 09:10.280
I'll pray for a good match for you.

09:20.679 --> 09:22.119
Take a few more servants with you.

09:22.440 --> 09:23.640
Go early and come back early.

09:25.799 --> 09:26.920
Got it.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.320
Cuique.

09:32.080 --> 09:33.280
We're leaving.

09:35.160 --> 09:37.480
- Second Young Lady, Young Lady Du,
- Second Young Lady, Young Lady Du,

09:37.490 --> 09:38.568
- take care.
- take care.

09:44.919 --> 09:46.040
Gantang.

09:46.360 --> 09:47.680
Go get Lanxiang.

09:47.879 --> 09:48.760
Yes.

09:49.679 --> 09:51.558
That wound of yours is still red.

09:51.559 --> 09:52.920
Will it leave a scar?

09:53.840 --> 09:55.199
I don't know either.

09:56.039 --> 09:57.160
Does it still hurt?

09:57.559 --> 09:58.680
No.

09:59.080 --> 10:00.079
Lanxiang.

10:01.879 --> 10:02.999
Gantang.

10:05.159 --> 10:06.558
Didn't you go to bathe?

10:06.559 --> 10:08.518
Why are you still in
those dirty clothes?

10:08.519 --> 10:09.479
Xiaolian came by.

10:09.480 --> 10:12.079
We got caught up talking,
so I was delayed for a while.

10:12.080 --> 10:13.638
Yuchan happened to need more water,

10:13.639 --> 10:15.319
so I gave her my hot water.

10:15.320 --> 10:17.280
I'll heat some more and bathe later.

10:17.320 --> 10:18.079
What's wrong?

10:18.080 --> 10:20.520
Young Master wants to see you.
You'd better hurry over.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.856
Then I'll leave you to your work.

10:22.904 --> 10:24.190
I should be going, too.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.359
Let's go.

10:45.039 --> 10:46.079
Young Master.

10:47.360 --> 10:48.798
When did Xiuwan

10:48.799 --> 10:50.520
become so close to Young Lady Du?

10:54.279 --> 10:55.640
I don't know.

10:57.679 --> 10:59.680
So there are things even you don't know.

11:03.159 --> 11:04.479
Keep an eye on them.

11:04.639 --> 11:06.638
See what Xiuwan and Young Lady Du

11:06.639 --> 11:08.119
usually do together.

11:08.840 --> 11:09.839
Yes.

11:14.840 --> 11:16.199
How is the wound

11:17.080 --> 11:18.199
on your neck?

11:19.919 --> 11:21.239
It's fine now.

11:22.000 --> 11:22.999
Doesn't it itch?

11:26.120 --> 11:27.560
It does itch a little.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.599
This is for the itching.

11:58.740 --> 12:01.940
♪Look at us♪

12:02.220 --> 12:06.700
♪We've shared
countless beautiful moments♪

12:08.568 --> 12:09.740
Thank you, Young Master.

12:09.759 --> 12:13.460
♪Through life's winding road,
we've weathered countless trials♪

12:14.980 --> 12:22.060
♪I'm blessed to spend each
peaceful day and night with you♪

12:23.140 --> 12:25.860
♪However deep the joy or sorrow♪

12:26.300 --> 12:29.459
♪There will always
be someone to share it with♪

12:29.460 --> 12:32.780
♪Our bond runs deep♪

12:32.860 --> 12:36.340
♪Binding us closely together♪

12:36.580 --> 12:39.499
♪After all
the questions life has brought♪

12:39.500 --> 12:44.220
♪This love has never
faded in the slightest♪

12:44.700 --> 12:48.780
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

12:48.820 --> 12:52.660
♪How fortunate
to find one person in a lifetime♪

12:52.700 --> 12:54.820
♪Through the gentle passing years♪

12:54.860 --> 13:01.020
♪My heart remains
as true to you as ever♪

13:18.039 --> 13:22.520
The total is 123 taels and eight coins.

13:23.639 --> 13:26.199
Next is four reams of xuan paper.

13:26.399 --> 13:28.359
Just write it right next to this.

13:28.360 --> 13:29.359
All right.

13:47.900 --> 13:52.860
(Yuchan. Lanxiang)

13:56.960 --> 13:57.638
Lanxiang.

13:57.639 --> 13:59.038
Go find me a back scratcher.

13:59.039 --> 14:00.520
My back is terribly itchy.

14:10.679 --> 14:12.199
You've broken out in a rash.

14:13.000 --> 14:13.999
Really?

14:14.072 --> 14:14.710
It's so itchy.

14:14.720 --> 14:16.280
Take a look at my back for me.

14:24.360 --> 14:25.592
It looks quite serious.

14:25.720 --> 14:28.040
You should go to the medical hall
and see a physician.

14:30.120 --> 14:33.040
It's nothing serious.
No need to see a physician.

14:33.559 --> 14:35.239
I probably caught a chill yesterday

14:35.240 --> 14:36.599
and broke out in hives.

14:36.720 --> 14:38.758
Later, go to Luxue Lodge for me

14:38.759 --> 14:41.040
and ask Young Lady Du
for some anti-itch ointment.

14:41.879 --> 14:42.439
All right.

14:42.440 --> 14:43.719
I'll go now.

14:49.300 --> 14:52.319
(Lin Residence, Luxue Lodge)

14:52.320 --> 14:53.839
We do have anti-itch ointment,

14:53.840 --> 14:56.479
but Lingdang usually keeps it.

14:56.960 --> 14:58.359
Early this morning, Young Lady Du

14:58.360 --> 14:59.839
took Lingdang and Second Young Lady

14:59.840 --> 15:01.678
to the temple to fulfill their vows.

15:01.679 --> 15:04.320
They probably won't be back
until this afternoon.

15:04.720 --> 15:06.119
When Young Lady Du returns,

15:06.120 --> 15:07.479
I'll ask her for the ointment

15:07.480 --> 15:08.839
and bring it over to you.

15:08.960 --> 15:09.959
All right.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.918
Yuchan's hives are quite severe.

15:11.919 --> 15:13.678
As soon as Young Lady Du returns,

15:13.679 --> 15:15.119
remember to bring the medicine over.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.239
I will.

15:37.960 --> 15:39.439
Young Lady Du

15:39.440 --> 15:41.040
brought this chess set from home?

15:41.360 --> 15:43.158
She only got it recently.

15:43.159 --> 15:44.798
Young Lady Du said her brother

15:44.799 --> 15:46.359
knew she enjoyed playing chess,

15:46.360 --> 15:48.440
so he bought her a new set as a gift.

15:59.879 --> 16:02.239
You just said Second Young Lady
and Young Lady Du

16:02.240 --> 16:03.719
went to the temple together.

16:03.720 --> 16:04.439
When did they

16:04.440 --> 16:06.119
become so close?

16:09.279 --> 16:13.199
I think it was around
the time Young Master was arrested.

16:16.120 --> 16:18.158
Young Lady Du is probably
gentle and considerate,

16:18.159 --> 16:20.558
so Second Young Lady
often came to talk to her,

16:20.559 --> 16:22.440
and the two of them
gradually became close.

16:25.240 --> 16:26.678
Don't tell Young Lady Du

16:26.679 --> 16:28.158
what I just said to you.

16:28.159 --> 16:29.439
If she asks,

16:29.440 --> 16:31.239
just say I came
for some anti-itch ointment,

16:31.240 --> 16:32.038
but she wasn't here,

16:32.039 --> 16:33.440
so I left.

16:34.399 --> 16:35.520
All right.

16:35.759 --> 16:36.760
I'm leaving.

16:55.320 --> 16:57.839
(A set of Yunzi stones
is worth a fortune.)

16:59.360 --> 17:01.119
(Where did Du Zheng get the money)

17:01.120 --> 17:03.599
(to buy Du Cuique
such expensive Yunzi stones?)

17:23.839 --> 17:24.879
Make way.

17:25.160 --> 17:26.280
Let His Lordship pass first.

17:57.640 --> 17:58.518
Grandpa,

17:58.519 --> 18:00.239
I'll help you push.

18:00.240 --> 18:01.800
Sir, we'll help you.

18:04.839 --> 18:05.879
Thank you.

18:10.200 --> 18:11.359
Thank you, My Lords.

18:11.440 --> 18:12.200
It's nothing.

18:42.759 --> 18:44.318
Lately, I've been troubled

18:44.319 --> 18:45.439
by a personal matter.

18:45.768 --> 18:47.096
It suddenly occurred to me

18:47.128 --> 18:48.870
that perhaps
I could discuss it with you.

18:49.359 --> 18:51.879
Your Lordship has given me
valuable guidance.

18:52.359 --> 18:53.919
If I can help ease your worries,

18:54.079 --> 18:55.280
I'll do everything I can.

18:56.559 --> 18:58.480
In private, just call me Yuan.

18:59.599 --> 19:00.560
Yuan.

19:03.176 --> 19:04.200
It's been eight years

19:04.248 --> 19:06.280
since Commandery
Princess Chenyang passed away.

19:06.519 --> 19:08.520
My mother has been urging me to remarry,

19:09.359 --> 19:11.720
but I've had my concerns
and put it off until now.

19:12.480 --> 19:13.879
A marriage joins two families.

19:14.039 --> 19:17.000
I don't expect a deeply loving
and devoted marriage,

19:17.440 --> 19:19.358
but at the very least,
we must be compatible

19:19.359 --> 19:20.800
and not grow to resent each other.

19:22.079 --> 19:23.358
I have only one daughter.

19:23.359 --> 19:24.639
She's already eleven.

19:24.839 --> 19:26.839
In a few years, she'll come of age,

19:27.559 --> 19:29.599
and my mother is getting older.

19:29.759 --> 19:31.439
No matter how much I love my daughter,

19:31.960 --> 19:33.760
a father can't take a mother's place.

19:36.720 --> 19:38.280
What you mean is...

19:48.008 --> 19:50.760
The position of madam of
the Marquis's Residence is still vacant.

19:52.440 --> 19:54.359
I intend to remarry.

20:02.559 --> 20:04.119
From what I've seen of you, Fengtai,

20:04.152 --> 20:06.390
and how the maids
of Lin Residence conduct themselves,

20:06.759 --> 20:09.320
it's clear that the Lin family
is kind and well-disciplined.

20:10.559 --> 20:12.480
I hear your younger sister
is still unmarried.

20:13.119 --> 20:14.240
I wonder if I...

20:17.319 --> 20:18.439
I wonder...

20:18.559 --> 20:19.159
if...

20:19.160 --> 20:20.439
perhaps...

20:25.720 --> 20:26.758
Yuan.

20:26.759 --> 20:28.000
My second aunt

20:28.160 --> 20:30.480
has recently been worrying
about Xiuwan's marriage.

20:31.319 --> 20:32.839
If you're interested,

20:33.079 --> 20:34.439
I'd be willing to help

20:34.440 --> 20:36.359
and sound out my second aunt.

20:37.944 --> 20:39.560
Then I'll have to trouble you, Fengtai,

20:39.680 --> 20:41.280
to put in a good word for me.

20:41.720 --> 20:42.399
Of course.

20:48.744 --> 20:50.136
Your Lordship, Young Master.

20:50.264 --> 20:53.336
Something happened at the Prison Office
of the Rear Military Command.

21:16.340 --> 21:19.130
(Zheng Baichuan, Duke Xianguo,
Jinling Joint Defense Commander)

21:19.144 --> 21:20.820
(Commander of the Rear Military Command)

21:23.800 --> 21:25.816
Commander Zheng.

21:33.799 --> 21:35.038
Commander,

21:35.039 --> 21:36.558
from our preliminary examination,

21:36.559 --> 21:39.079
all twelve died from poisoning.

21:39.200 --> 21:40.999
The poison was probably put

21:41.000 --> 21:42.679
in their breakfast this morning.

21:59.768 --> 22:02.599
The porridge for all the prisoners
was cooked together,

22:03.080 --> 22:04.990
yet only the Wo pirates
in these two cells

22:05.000 --> 22:06.239
were poisoned.

22:06.240 --> 22:09.239
That means the cook didn't poison them.

22:09.240 --> 22:11.688
The jailer who served
the porridge must be responsible.

22:12.680 --> 22:14.000
Where is that jailer?

22:16.400 --> 22:17.399
Commander,

22:17.400 --> 22:19.758
the jailer who served breakfast
to the prisoners today

22:19.759 --> 22:20.798
was Wang Er.

22:20.799 --> 22:22.159
He must have poisoned them.

22:22.160 --> 22:22.719
I...

22:22.720 --> 22:24.520
I don't know anything!

22:28.079 --> 22:28.879
Wang Er!

22:28.880 --> 22:29.838
It wasn't me! It wasn't!

22:29.839 --> 22:31.879
It wasn't me!

22:38.799 --> 22:40.119
He hasn't been dead long.

22:40.168 --> 22:41.910
He must have
taken poison to kill himself.

22:46.440 --> 22:48.119
Assistant Commander Lin is right.

22:48.200 --> 22:50.439
There are still traces
of the poison on his fingers.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.599
Fine.

22:57.519 --> 22:58.399
Fine.

23:01.000 --> 23:03.320
He may be dead,
but he can't hide the truth.

23:03.720 --> 23:04.919
I refuse to believe

23:05.200 --> 23:06.758
that after poisoning so many people,

23:06.759 --> 23:08.639
he left no clues behind.

23:10.000 --> 23:11.480
Investigate Wang Er's family.

23:11.759 --> 23:14.240
Find out who he usually associated with.

23:14.799 --> 23:15.599
- Yes.
- Yes.

23:26.480 --> 23:26.838
Quick.

23:26.839 --> 23:27.800
Get to work.

23:32.759 --> 23:35.200
We only interrogated
six Wo pirates yesterday.

23:35.384 --> 23:37.910
We hadn't even finished
the preliminary questioning.

23:39.224 --> 23:40.960
Someone in
the imperial court is involved.

23:43.319 --> 23:44.280
I know.

23:44.984 --> 23:46.950
Otherwise, you wouldn't
have sent two maids

23:46.960 --> 23:48.320
to deliver a message to me.

23:49.279 --> 23:51.758
I just didn't expect their reach

23:51.759 --> 23:53.800
to extend this far.

23:54.760 --> 23:57.430
Even the cells at the Prison Office
of the Rear Military Command

23:57.440 --> 23:58.919
couldn't keep them out.

24:01.560 --> 24:02.910
Are you afraid, Your Lordship?

24:05.799 --> 24:06.960
Trying to provoke me?

24:08.920 --> 24:11.159
I am Marquis Yongchang.
What have I to fear?

24:13.079 --> 24:14.200
But you,

24:15.000 --> 24:16.399
a mere Assistant Commander,

24:16.400 --> 24:18.079
have only just been reinstated.

24:18.160 --> 24:19.760
You'd better think this through.

24:23.519 --> 24:25.359
You're a hereditary marquis.

24:25.880 --> 24:28.760
I earned my rank as Assistant Commander
on the battlefield.

24:34.408 --> 24:36.150
We'll investigate this to the end.

24:36.559 --> 24:37.599
To the very end.

24:47.960 --> 24:49.119
You have a slight fever.

24:49.599 --> 24:51.240
Do you feel unwell anywhere else?

24:52.160 --> 24:54.119
After applying Young Lady Du's ointment,

24:54.160 --> 24:55.879
it doesn't itch anymore.

24:56.920 --> 24:58.040
It's just that

24:59.039 --> 25:00.320
my head hurts,

25:00.799 --> 25:02.119
and I feel weak.

25:02.559 --> 25:03.599
Here's the water.

25:20.200 --> 25:22.000
It doesn't look like hives.

25:22.240 --> 25:23.399
I'll go to First Madam

25:23.400 --> 25:25.838
and ask her to send
someone for a physician.

25:25.839 --> 25:26.839
No.

25:27.119 --> 25:28.240
You can't.

25:28.559 --> 25:29.320
I...

25:31.480 --> 25:32.800
We can't let First Madam know.

25:33.352 --> 25:34.744
If First Madam finds out,

25:34.792 --> 25:37.430
she'll be afraid Yuchan might pass
the illness to Young Master.

25:38.400 --> 25:41.280
She'll have Yuchan moved out
of the residence immediately.

25:43.144 --> 25:45.288
Then the food, clothing,
and other necessities

25:45.290 --> 25:46.760
won't be as good as they are here.

25:48.720 --> 25:50.599
Even getting
hot water would be difficult.

25:52.319 --> 25:55.000
A minor illness could become serious.

25:56.079 --> 25:58.919
My mother said many maids who fall ill

25:59.240 --> 26:01.040
are sent away
like that and never return.

26:11.839 --> 26:13.560
I'll go to Madam Han

26:14.400 --> 26:15.919
and find an excuse

26:16.000 --> 26:17.688
to leave the residence
and buy something.

26:17.920 --> 26:20.278
Once I get to the apothecary,
I'll describe the symptoms

26:20.280 --> 26:22.440
and quietly bring some medicine back.

26:22.450 --> 26:24.070
A proper diagnosis requires
observation, listening,

26:24.080 --> 26:25.240
questioning, and pulse-taking.

26:25.256 --> 26:26.792
We don't know anything about medicine.

26:26.824 --> 26:29.000
If we just describe the symptoms
and get some medicine,

26:29.048 --> 26:30.960
the wrong medicine
could delay treatment.

26:34.279 --> 26:37.118
Doesn't Young Lady Du know medicine?

26:37.119 --> 26:38.599
Why don't we ask Young Lady Du?

26:44.400 --> 26:46.399
Young Lady Du is
First Madam's honored guest.

26:46.400 --> 26:48.040
Wouldn't that be inappropriate?

26:51.359 --> 26:53.079
Lanxiang is right.

26:53.640 --> 26:55.320
We're only maids.

26:55.464 --> 26:58.550
We only dared to ask for some ointment
because we could rely on Young Master

26:58.559 --> 27:00.359
and First Madam's standing.

27:01.319 --> 27:03.679
If we treat Young Lady Du
like a physician,

27:03.799 --> 27:05.560
First Madam
will certainly be displeased.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.520
Then what should we do?

27:09.440 --> 27:10.679
I'll go find Jiugao.

27:10.839 --> 27:12.038
I'll ask Jiugao to find a way

27:12.039 --> 27:13.479
to bring in a physician

27:13.480 --> 27:15.040
he knows discreetly.

27:19.112 --> 27:21.670
The sooner you take the medicine,
the sooner you'll recover.

27:22.000 --> 27:24.679
It'll be more troublesome
if we wait until you get worse.

27:29.519 --> 27:30.359
Go.

27:32.119 --> 27:33.599
Take good care of Yuchan.

28:08.240 --> 28:09.320
Young Master.

28:11.240 --> 28:12.399
Where are you going?

28:14.440 --> 28:16.110
(About what happened at Zhichun Hall,)

28:16.119 --> 28:17.719
(if I'm to keep it from First Madam,)

28:17.720 --> 28:19.240
(I'll have to let Young Master know.)

28:20.799 --> 28:23.919
I was just about to find
a servant to get Jiugao.

28:24.319 --> 28:25.960
Yuchan has a slight fever.

28:26.119 --> 28:28.318
I want Jiugao to bring in a physician

28:28.319 --> 28:29.800
to examine Yuchan.

28:35.640 --> 28:38.040
(Scheming from head to toe...)

28:42.200 --> 28:43.320
Young Master.

28:44.799 --> 28:47.439
Take my card
and find Physician Li, who regularly

28:47.440 --> 28:49.119
checks Old Madam's pulse.

28:49.640 --> 28:51.038
First, have Physician Li

28:51.039 --> 28:52.999
check Old Madam's pulse,

28:53.000 --> 28:54.000
and then bring him

28:54.599 --> 28:56.040
to Zhichun Hall for a visit.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.359
Thank you, Young Master.

29:00.559 --> 29:02.879
I'll tell Madam Han

29:02.880 --> 29:04.280
to keep this quiet for now.

29:04.599 --> 29:07.439
You must all keep quiet about it, too.

29:09.200 --> 29:10.000
Yes.

29:10.400 --> 29:12.278
Young Master,
before the night curfew begins,

29:12.280 --> 29:13.224
I'll hurry over there

29:13.230 --> 29:15.159
and ask Physician Li to come
tomorrow morning.

29:15.319 --> 29:16.200
Go.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.520
I'll change my clothes.

29:35.960 --> 29:37.439
Come with me to Rongzhang House.

29:41.880 --> 29:44.200
I was worried Xiuwan
might take it badly before,

29:44.720 --> 29:47.399
but now she's acting
as if nothing happened.

29:47.480 --> 29:49.960
She spends every day
happily with Young Lady Du.

29:52.119 --> 29:53.399
Instead, I'm the one

29:53.839 --> 29:55.960
who can't eat or sleep all day.

29:58.552 --> 30:01.030
There were families who would
have made suitable matches,

30:01.039 --> 30:03.599
but I turned them all down
because of the Xie family.

30:04.440 --> 30:06.800
Now, after all that,

30:06.960 --> 30:09.599
how could I possibly go back to them?

30:11.119 --> 30:13.359
Don't worry too much.

30:13.720 --> 30:16.320
I think Xiuwan is blessed
with good fortune.

30:16.440 --> 30:18.118
She might just find

30:18.119 --> 30:20.079
an even better match
than the Xie family.

30:20.319 --> 30:22.118
We've considered every suitable family

30:22.119 --> 30:23.038
in all of Jinling City.

30:23.039 --> 30:25.280
Where could we find anyone
better than the Xie family?

30:26.240 --> 30:27.639
Young Master is here.

30:27.920 --> 30:29.040
Young Master.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.399
Wait here for me.

30:33.799 --> 30:34.560
Yes.

30:41.759 --> 30:43.999
Mother. Aunt Lingxiao.

30:44.000 --> 30:45.838
What brings you here at this hour?

30:45.839 --> 30:47.240
Is something the matter?

30:48.319 --> 30:49.719
I need to speak with Aunt Lingxiao.

30:49.720 --> 30:51.199
I heard she was here with you,

30:51.200 --> 30:52.280
so I came over.

30:56.799 --> 30:57.919
Speak with me?

31:01.240 --> 31:02.439
What is it?

31:03.119 --> 31:04.838
Because of the padded coats,

31:04.839 --> 31:07.040
Marquis Yongchang and I became friends.

31:07.319 --> 31:09.040
He thinks highly of the Lin family

31:09.319 --> 31:10.439
and wants...

31:12.039 --> 31:13.679
He wants to marry Xiuwan.

31:16.839 --> 31:19.639
Mar... Mar...

31:20.720 --> 31:22.480
Mar...

31:23.279 --> 31:26.399
You mean Marquis Yongchang,
Yuan Shaohui?

31:27.319 --> 31:28.560
Exactly.

31:30.920 --> 31:33.479
What sort of man is the Marquis?

31:33.480 --> 31:34.359
Right.

31:34.720 --> 31:36.598
Although we haven't
known each other long,

31:36.599 --> 31:38.359
we hit it off
as if we'd been old friends.

31:38.400 --> 31:40.570
Yuan is accomplished
in both civil and military affairs

31:40.584 --> 31:41.710
and has a steady temperament.

31:41.720 --> 31:43.038
He would make a good husband.

31:43.039 --> 31:44.159
Good.

31:44.519 --> 31:45.199
Sit.

31:45.200 --> 31:46.119
Sit.

31:47.279 --> 31:49.639
Of course I know Marquis Yongchang
would be a fine match.

31:49.920 --> 31:50.960
But now,

31:51.000 --> 31:53.480
your second uncle
doesn't even hold an official post.

31:54.039 --> 31:55.119
I'm afraid...

31:56.200 --> 31:58.280
I'm afraid the match
may be beyond our reach.

31:58.480 --> 31:59.879
Don't worry, Aunt Lingxiao.

32:00.200 --> 32:02.239
Yuan isn't someone
who cares about such things.

32:02.240 --> 32:04.040
Since he brought it up himself,

32:04.119 --> 32:05.639
he must sincerely wish to marry Xiuwan.

32:05.720 --> 32:07.079
Wonderful.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.479
Didn't Shunhua just say

32:09.480 --> 32:11.000
that perhaps Xiuwan could find

32:11.080 --> 32:13.030
an even better match
than the Xie family?

32:13.039 --> 32:13.838
See?

32:13.839 --> 32:15.318
And now she really has.

32:15.319 --> 32:16.520
She has.

32:16.559 --> 32:20.000
How old is Marquis Yongchang?

32:20.720 --> 32:24.320
Could he be a little too old?

32:24.920 --> 32:26.200
Thirty-two.

32:26.759 --> 32:27.959
Thirty-two?

32:27.960 --> 32:29.959
Not old at all.

32:29.960 --> 32:32.599
An older man knows better
how to cherish his wife.

32:35.519 --> 32:37.118
Did the late Commandery Princess

32:37.119 --> 32:38.960
leave behind a child?

32:40.359 --> 32:41.479
She has a daughter

32:41.480 --> 32:43.079
who's already eleven.

32:45.559 --> 32:47.040
A daughter.

32:48.160 --> 32:49.919
A daughter isn't a problem.

32:50.359 --> 32:52.558
In a few years, once she's betrothed,

32:52.560 --> 32:54.072
she'll marry and leave the household.

32:54.319 --> 32:56.078
If she gets along well with Xiuwan,

32:56.080 --> 32:57.512
they can spend more time together.

32:57.544 --> 32:59.470
If not, they can keep their distance.

32:59.480 --> 33:01.240
Either way, it won't be a problem.

33:01.319 --> 33:03.320
It won't.

33:04.072 --> 33:05.950
If you have no objections,
Aunt Lingxiao,

33:05.960 --> 33:08.119
- I'll give Yuan an answer tomorrow.
- Xiuwan.

33:08.248 --> 33:08.790
Don't pull me.

33:08.799 --> 33:11.320
Have him send a matchmaker
to formally discuss the marriage.

33:11.920 --> 33:13.200
Good.

33:13.279 --> 33:14.560
Good.

33:18.960 --> 33:20.240
Mother. Aunt Lingxiao.

33:20.279 --> 33:21.879
I'll take my leave now.

33:26.440 --> 33:27.280
Let's go.

33:34.599 --> 33:36.679
This is wonderful!

33:36.759 --> 33:39.118
Everyone in Jinling City knows

33:39.119 --> 33:41.159
Marquis Yongchang is a capable man.

33:41.176 --> 33:43.270
More importantly,
all these years his inner household

33:43.279 --> 33:45.040
has remained free of concubines.

33:45.559 --> 33:48.118
Back when the Commandery Princess
first passed away,

33:48.119 --> 33:50.480
so many families wanted
to arrange a marriage with him.

33:50.720 --> 33:51.558
And now,

33:51.559 --> 33:52.558
such a wonderful match

33:52.559 --> 33:55.040
has actually come to our Xiuwan.

33:55.759 --> 33:57.358
If she marries him,

33:57.359 --> 33:59.560
she'll be the Marchioness.

33:59.759 --> 34:02.798
Then I'll have to show off

34:02.799 --> 34:04.480
in front of the Xie family.

34:04.759 --> 34:06.038
Show off?

34:06.039 --> 34:07.200
This is wonderful!

34:07.519 --> 34:08.640
Xiuwan.

34:08.760 --> 34:09.999
Xiuwan!

34:11.400 --> 34:12.439
Xiuwan.

34:26.920 --> 34:29.399
This isn't something

34:29.400 --> 34:30.640
we can solve by making a scene.

34:33.199 --> 34:34.320
Let's go.

34:58.199 --> 34:58.959
I will never

34:58.960 --> 35:00.600
marry an old man.

35:00.840 --> 35:02.319
I'm a person,

35:02.320 --> 35:04.280
not something for my family to show off.

35:05.159 --> 35:07.200
Marquis's wife, Madam Ma, huh?

35:07.240 --> 35:09.128
Whoever wants
those titles can have them.

35:21.599 --> 35:23.158
Anyone Jinqi approves of

35:23.159 --> 35:24.559
can't be that bad.

35:26.360 --> 35:27.600
What do you know?

35:31.440 --> 35:32.559
You two,

35:33.800 --> 35:35.839
don't go around telling anyone.

35:40.040 --> 35:41.430
We may be foolish, but even we know

35:41.440 --> 35:43.200
something like this
can't be talked about.

35:44.039 --> 35:44.959
All right.

35:45.159 --> 35:46.479
It's almost dark.

35:46.520 --> 35:48.350
You should hurry back
to your own courtyards.

35:49.199 --> 35:50.479
Cuique.

36:02.760 --> 36:04.959
Xiuwan isn't close to us anymore.

36:05.920 --> 36:07.439
She only spends time with Cuique.

36:08.880 --> 36:10.919
She's been like this all this time.

36:16.920 --> 36:17.799
Xiuru.

36:17.800 --> 36:20.039
I know you're worried
about your marriage, too.

36:20.119 --> 36:21.038
Don't worry.

36:21.039 --> 36:22.319
I'll ask Mother

36:22.320 --> 36:24.240
to find you a good match.

36:25.400 --> 36:26.760
Someone like me,

36:26.808 --> 36:29.352
with nothing outstanding in virtue,
looks, speech, or needlework,

36:29.559 --> 36:31.640
could hardly hope for a good match.

36:31.704 --> 36:33.750
Don't make things difficult
for her on my account.

36:33.760 --> 36:35.479
You are wonderful.

36:35.480 --> 36:37.559
I'm sure you'll find
a wonderful husband.

36:52.400 --> 36:54.280
I just have a few red rashes.

36:54.340 --> 36:56.300
(Lin Residence, Qingsu House)
They're a little itchy.

36:56.312 --> 36:57.430
Why can't I get out of bed?

36:58.719 --> 37:01.039
You have a rash, so you shouldn't
be exposed to the wind.

37:01.360 --> 37:03.158
Stay inside for a few days.

37:03.159 --> 37:04.720
You can go out once you're better.

37:06.960 --> 37:07.999
First Madam.

37:08.320 --> 37:09.800
Physician Li is here.

37:13.000 --> 37:14.760
Xiushu hasn't come of age yet,

37:14.800 --> 37:16.970
and Physician Li
has watched her grow up.

37:17.000 --> 37:17.790
It's fine.

37:17.800 --> 37:19.238
Show him in.

37:19.239 --> 37:20.200
Yes.

37:21.960 --> 37:22.718
Physician Li,

37:22.719 --> 37:23.800
this way, please.

37:25.920 --> 37:27.120
Physician Li.

37:27.360 --> 37:29.600
Greetings, First Madam Lin.

37:29.719 --> 37:30.839
Please sit.

37:30.920 --> 37:32.200
Grandpa Li.

37:33.960 --> 37:35.078
Let me take a look.

37:35.079 --> 37:36.640
Where do you feel unwell?

37:41.000 --> 37:42.359
When she woke up this morning,

37:42.360 --> 37:43.158
her maid

37:43.159 --> 37:44.759
noticed that Xiushu

37:44.760 --> 37:46.080
had developed a red rash.

37:46.232 --> 37:48.070
We know she can't
be around peach blossoms,

37:48.070 --> 37:50.264
so there isn't
a single peach tree in the residence.

37:50.312 --> 37:52.240
I also asked about her diet just now.

37:52.360 --> 37:53.999
She's eaten the same as usual.

37:55.192 --> 37:56.150
Other than the itching,

37:56.159 --> 37:57.919
do you feel unwell anywhere else?

37:59.480 --> 38:00.800
No.

38:00.880 --> 38:02.280
It's just a little itchy.

38:05.000 --> 38:06.640
As spring turns to summer,

38:06.679 --> 38:07.959
the weather is unpredictable.

38:08.344 --> 38:10.870
The elderly and children
sometimes have trouble adjusting.

38:11.630 --> 38:13.976
You must have come
into contact with pollen

38:14.008 --> 38:15.430
while playing in the garden

38:15.440 --> 38:16.839
and developed a pollen rash.

38:17.360 --> 38:18.559
It's nothing serious.

38:18.920 --> 38:20.080
As it happens,

38:20.320 --> 38:22.559
I've just prepared medicine
for pollen rashes.

38:26.480 --> 38:27.559
Here.

38:27.840 --> 38:30.039
Take one in the morning
and one at night with water.

38:30.360 --> 38:31.304
All right.

38:31.528 --> 38:33.208
Thank you for your trouble,
Physician Li.

38:33.210 --> 38:34.038
Not at all.

38:34.039 --> 38:35.319
Thank you, Grandpa Li.

38:35.320 --> 38:36.959
It's my duty.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.879
See Physician Li out.

38:44.199 --> 38:45.399
Physician Li,

38:45.760 --> 38:46.999
this way.

38:50.079 --> 38:50.999
I...

38:51.720 --> 38:52.568
You...

38:52.584 --> 38:54.150
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

38:54.159 --> 38:56.479
What are you doing
in the young ladies' courtyard?

38:57.119 --> 38:58.800
Young Master sent me.

38:59.432 --> 39:01.640
He told me to escort
Physician Li out of the residence.

39:04.616 --> 39:05.864
Madam, no need to see me.

39:05.880 --> 39:07.720
Jiugao can escort me just as well.

39:09.920 --> 39:10.598
Then...

39:10.599 --> 39:12.600
Take care, Physician Li.

39:13.800 --> 39:14.839
Please.

39:17.992 --> 39:20.296
She's feeling a little unwell.
Please take a look at her.

39:20.312 --> 39:21.830
Why is he being so secretive?

39:21.840 --> 39:23.519
I knew it couldn't be anything good.

39:58.480 --> 40:01.479
Did your skin suddenly
turn bright red in patches,

40:01.480 --> 40:02.720
as if painted with cinnabar?

40:04.719 --> 40:06.080
Yes.

40:06.480 --> 40:09.120
Then soon after, did you
develop a headache and fever?

40:10.719 --> 40:13.640
Yes, and I feel weak.

40:14.000 --> 40:17.080
A fever naturally makes you feel weak.

40:18.239 --> 40:19.439
This is erysipelas,

40:19.880 --> 40:21.839
caused by pathogenic wind and heat.

40:22.920 --> 40:23.879
In severe cases,

40:23.880 --> 40:25.176
it can develop into an abscess.

40:25.896 --> 40:27.550
Not only will the pain
become unbearable,

40:27.559 --> 40:28.919
but the skin may also ulcerate

40:28.920 --> 40:30.240
or even become necrotic.

40:30.679 --> 40:32.720
Fortunately,
you sought treatment in time.

40:39.800 --> 40:42.518
Keep her diet light
for the next few days.

40:42.519 --> 40:43.959
Keep her clean,

40:44.328 --> 40:46.120
and make sure she gets plenty of rest.

40:47.032 --> 40:49.290
She must avoid foods that
could aggravate the condition.

40:49.940 --> 40:52.180
(Astragalus, Coptis,
Phellodendron, Licorice, Forsythia)

40:52.440 --> 40:53.800
Send someone to get these herbs.

40:53.864 --> 40:55.310
Boil two bowls of water down to one.

40:55.320 --> 40:56.760
Take it twice a day.

40:56.800 --> 40:57.959
I'll get the medicine.

41:03.679 --> 41:04.439
All right.

41:06.079 --> 41:07.200
Go.

41:11.480 --> 41:12.638
Thank you, Physician.

41:12.639 --> 41:13.519
You're welcome.

41:18.320 --> 41:19.558
Good thing we listened to you

41:19.559 --> 41:21.399
and brought in a physician in time.

41:22.719 --> 41:25.118
Even with all my ideas,
I couldn't have managed this alone.

41:25.119 --> 41:28.439
Thankfully, Jiugao took care
of everything for us.

41:29.559 --> 41:30.479
Yes.

41:30.480 --> 41:32.479
Thank goodness for Jiugao.

41:34.760 --> 41:36.240
You two,

41:36.360 --> 41:38.080
that's enough.

41:46.020 --> 41:50.100
(Enduring the Cold)

41:55.260 --> 41:58.780
(Tongcao, Lin Xiuru's second-class maid)

41:59.400 --> 42:01.319
Now that Fourth Young Lady is ill,

42:01.320 --> 42:03.160
Young Lady must be lonely.

42:04.559 --> 42:06.359
Second Young Lady is really something.

42:06.360 --> 42:08.328
Instead of spending time
with her own sisters,

42:08.344 --> 42:10.030
she spends all day with

42:10.039 --> 42:11.399
that Young Lady Du.

43:04.820 --> 43:07.740
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:11.400 --> 43:12.839
Are you going out, Young Master?

43:12.840 --> 43:14.280
The night curfew has already begun.

43:15.199 --> 43:16.399
Tonight,

43:16.639 --> 43:18.359
I never left Zhichun Hall.

43:22.840 --> 43:24.439
Young Master was tired,

43:24.440 --> 43:26.718
so I helped Young Master
take a hot bath.

43:26.719 --> 43:27.518
After his bath,

43:27.519 --> 43:30.479
Young Master fell asleep and
slept straight through until morning.

43:34.840 --> 43:36.559
You're too clever

43:38.360 --> 43:41.400
to be a maid.

43:56.741 --> 44:00.861
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:03.701 --> 44:08.221
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:09.501 --> 44:13.421
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:14.101 --> 44:16.861
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:17.581 --> 44:19.901
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:19.901 --> 44:22.981
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:24.501 --> 44:28.741
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:31.661 --> 44:35.821
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:37.621 --> 44:41.181
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:41.181 --> 44:44.741
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:45.541 --> 44:51.221
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:51.581 --> 44:55.901
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:56.261 --> 44:59.221
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:59.221 --> 45:02.981
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:02.981 --> 45:05.861
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:05.861 --> 45:09.941
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:09.941 --> 45:13.301
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:13.301 --> 45:17.061
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:17.061 --> 45:21.061
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

